From: trzz1214 <162259342+trzz1214@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:07:57 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] input: HD Haptics on by default, settings page from the
 RenHDrum table (plans 119 step 7 / 120 step 4)

DualSense HD Haptics (USB speaker + trigger kick, Bluetooth report 0x36) follows a switch in the HD Rumble dialog instead of dualsense_bo3.txt. The dialog is drawn from the core settings table; values are saved as key=value in qt-config.ini [RenHDrum]. The driver reads the core value store (to_config, shape_amplitude, Xbox Direct) and the old hd_rumble_* / dualsense_* / xbox_* Settings are removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
